WEBVTT

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:32.520
Go, Shoot!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.330
Go, Voltic Ape!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.330
Dranzer!!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:20.620
The time to settle things with
Ozma and his team has finally come.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:25.870
Following Max, Kai won, and
was able to protect his Sacred Beast.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.640
Byakko has also returned to Rei,

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:32.630
and now, the battle between
Takao and Ozma is about to begin.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.260
Byakko...

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.130
Why don't you
give it up, Ozma?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.320
You should know now!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.300
You can't seal
our Sacred Beasts!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.640
As long as our hearts are
linked to our Sacred Beasts,

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.960
they can't be sealed.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.730
That's the bond we
share with our Sacred Beasts!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.440
Actin' tough, huh?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.500
What now, Ozma?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.810
At this rate...

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.230
Behold, Ozma.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.330
This is the lineage
of our clan.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.900
Our elders lived,
thinking only of sealing

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.220
the four Sacred Beasts.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:26.360
From now on, the Saint Shields
shall carry forth their will!

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:30.120
Now, you must fulfill the
mission of our ancestors,

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.940
that has been
handed down to you.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.310
Without fail, I will...

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.950
carry out...

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.360
my clan's--

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.920
I am...

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.870
a Saint Shield...

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.760
I do not lose!

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:41.190
The Saint Shields' duty...
is to seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.070
I will sever your
bonds myself.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.040
And they won't come
back out this time!

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.410
I'll seal them deep
inside the tablet!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.410
Starting with your
Seiryu, Kinomiya!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.970
That's right!
The battle's just gettin' started!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.800
Show 'em what
you can do, Ozma!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.700
Then let's do it.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.730
If you think you can
cut our bond, then try it!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:18.690
Here we go, Kinomiya!

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.740
--Three! Two! One!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.480
--Go, Shoot!

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.510
Flash Leopard!!

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.740
Seiryu!!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.380
Seiryu!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.730
Go, Flash Leopard!

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.410
Dragoon's getting chased!

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.910
Dang, he's powerful!

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.870
You can do it, Takao!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.580
Don't lose, Takao!

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.370
That's it, Ozma!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.920
Tear Dragoon to pieces!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.280
We are the chosen ones.
The Saint Shields!

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.660
Our duty is to seal
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:38.700
I will seal Seiryu
with my own hands!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.060
Takao!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.590
Push him back, Dragoon!

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.570
Push him back!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.870
You won't!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.200
Dragoon is losing power!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.370
Takao!

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.920
Finish him off!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.290
Takao!!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.900
I'm not gonna lose!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.960
Seiryu!!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.310
Flash Leopard!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:27.650
Yes! He pushed
back Leopard!

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.020
That's the way, Takao!

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.100
Damn! He was
so close, too!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.560
What's up, Ozma?

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.870
You can't seal Seiryu
if you play like that!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.420
Curse you...

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.700
This time, I will
finish you off!

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.560
He's not losing.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.190
They're even!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.500
That's it, Takao!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.470
Keep it up!

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:58.450
Go Ozma!
Don't lose to Dragoon!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.060
We are the Saint Shields...

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.510
A clan born to seal
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:10.480
I will seal Seiryu myself!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.670
I'm not gonna
hand over Seiryu.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.910
Not now! Not ever!

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.570
--Go!!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.480
Now it's our turn!

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.240
Here we go!!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:32.240
Now Flash Leopard
is being chased!

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.420
Ozma!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.180
Ozma...

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:55.670
From now, the Saint Shields
shall carry forth their will!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:59.780
Now, you must fulfill the
mission of our ancestors,

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.960
that has been
handed down to you.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.800
I am a Saint Shield...

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:07.200
I cannot...

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.520
I cannot lose now!

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.390
What?!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:17.960
Cross Fire!!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:30.770
Takao!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.550
Takao!!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:36.860
He did it!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.300
He beat Dragoon!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.570
Ozma!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.420
Dragoon is still spinning!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.840
But how?!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.570
I won't go down so easily.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.350
Our battle is
just getting started!

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.080
Takao!

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.060
Why...

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.610
Because they don't
want to lose.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:11.830
Kinomiya doesn't.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.360
Nor Seiryu!

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.210
What?!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.300
I don't think you
guys get it, but

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.410
we have everything on
the line in this battle!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.480
That's why Seiryu
responds to me!

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:28.910
If I don't give up,
then Seiryu will respond!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.320
That's our bond!

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:34.300
If you just fight
for your mission,

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.590
you can't cut that bond!

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.530
Damn you, Kinomiya...

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.170
For making light
of our battle...

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.520
I will not let this pass!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:50.560
I will bury you with Seiryu!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.950
Flash Leopard!!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:58.480
What?!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.310
Flash Leopard!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.360
What?!

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:24.050
Anyone who makes light of our
battle will not be forgiven!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.780
Prepare yourself, Kinomiya.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.800
I'm going to
drop you into hell!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.210
Flash Leopard!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.570
What?!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.280
Takao! Dodge!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.320
Is this how you battle?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.390
I'll take it on!

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.520
Takao!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.390
Seiryu!!

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.460
Seiryu!

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.870
Go, Flash Leopard!

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.930
Cut him to pieces!

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.040
He's totally getting chased...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.340
The difference in
power is too great.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.070
Takao...

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:29.920
Darn!

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.240
What a battle...

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.120
This isn't even
about sealing anymore...

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:47.580
Ozma...

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.280
I will...

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.360
I will...!

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:00.190
I will destroy you myself!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.740
Dragoon!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.960
Flash Leopard!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.650
Show him our power!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.440
Seiryu!!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.790
Seiryu's going to
lose if this keeps up...!

00:14:58.310 --> 00:14:59.500
I won't lose...!

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.300
You're persistent!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.800
Hurry up and die!!

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.380
Ozma, stop!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.630
Flash Leopard is
gonna burn itself out!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:24.930
Ozma!!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.560
No point in talking to him.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:33.570
All he has left is
defeating Kinomiya.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:38.000
He doesn't care what
happens to Flash Leopard to do it.

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.820
I will not accept this.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:44.140
That my way of
battling won't work...

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.730
Kinomiya...
I will defeat you.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.340
Ozma...

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.220
He's so powerful...

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.680
Dragoon is losing power!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.110
Takao!

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:03.460
You can do it!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.610
Takao!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.870
I won't lose...

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.440
I won't lose...!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.720
Seiryu!!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.720
He pushed him back!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.190
You can fight a
good battle after all.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.110
I'm impressed.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.590
Save your compliments!

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:50.760
What?!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.070
Take a look!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.080
That's impossible!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.640
Dragoon's Attack Ring!

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:07.330
Flash Leopard
must've scratched it off!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.220
Dragoon's going to be
in pieces at this rate!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.320
So then, Seiryu will...!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.020
Attaboy, Ozma!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.890
All right, Kinomiya.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:22.020
Time to give up
and accept defeat.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.720
Huh?! But Seiryu...

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:40.030
If Dragoon breaks, you
won't have a place to return to!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.940
I understand, Seiryu.

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:51.360
You believe in me.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:54.270
You'll fight this battle with
me until the very end, right?

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.430
When you go
down, I go down!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.200
Let's burn out together!

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:06.880
Here we go, Seiryu.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.940
Let's show him what
we can do together!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.150
What?

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.720
Wait, Takao!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.640
Don't be hasty!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.470
Takao!

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.560
Don't stop him.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:18.510
But if Dragoon
breaks, then Seiryu...

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:21.920
Takao's well aware.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.960
But the same applies
to Ozma's Bey!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.120
This battle can't be
stopped by anyone.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.040
Takao...

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:34.320
Is this your bond?

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:35.850
Trusting in each other,

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:38.420
fighting for each
other until the end...

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.750
But I will not lose!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:44.400
My mission will not
lose to their bond.

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:49.010
Let's go, Kinomiya! This is
the end for you and Seiryu!

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:50.560
Flash Leopard!

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:52.800
I won't lose! Dragoon!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:03.280
Dragoon won't last
if this keeps up!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.400
Takao! Please!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.780
You have to stop!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.030
Stop, Ozma!

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:12.820
Flash Leopard
can't take any more!

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:13.990
Ozma!!

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.650
Here I go, Kinomiya!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.380
Let's do it, Ozma!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.300
Cross Fire!!

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.050
Hyper Victory Tornado!!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.020
A draw!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:57.270
Dragoon...

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.760
Flash Leopard...

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.690
He's up...

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.190
I...

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:16.660
Where's Seiryu?!

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.200
Where's my Seiryu?!

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.570
He's fine.

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:21.750
Dragoon...

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.990
The bond between the BBA
team and the four Sacred Beasts...

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.480
I see it clearly now.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.800
Maybe it'll be all right.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.920
What do you mean?

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:37.950
That the only way to protect the
four Sacred Beasts isn't just to seal them.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:38.870
So...

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:39.550
Yeah.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.760
Kinomiya.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.630
We leave the four Sacred
Beasts in your hands.

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.640
Bonds with the
Sacred Beasts...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.640
There's nothing to
worry about, then!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.770
Yusuf...

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.620
But don't forget!

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.440
We won't hold back if
those bonds are broken!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:59.730
Then we will seal
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.660
Kinomiya.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:05.200
Take care of
the Sacred Beasts.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:08.960
Let's go.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:09.980
Ozma!

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:12.730
That was a great battle!

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:14.730
We'll meet again, right?

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.670
And then we can battle?

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:19.880
We don't have
winner yet, after all.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.560
I'll be waiting, Ozma.

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:04.070
Another Blader with a tablet
Sacred Beast appears before Takao.

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:06.590
Rei takes him on.

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:09.700
Pushed into a corner,
Rei finds courage in--

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:11.000
U-unbelievable!

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:15.230
By the way, where do
you find courage, director?

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:17.330
"In a closet?"

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:19.870
That's storage,
not courage!

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:22.120
Watch the next
episode too, please!
